### Demonstrates a fixed prompt on the flash model
GET http://localhost:8080/tournament

### Demonstrates a prompt template with a date parameter
GET http://localhost:8080/matches?date=15-07-2026

### Demonstrates a prompt template with a parameter, on the same route
GET http://localhost:8080/matches?stage=quarter-finals

### Demonstrates per-prompt options: temperature 0.6 overrides the yaml default of 0.0
GET http://localhost:8080/story?team=morocco